# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-cookieyes.php:58
msgid "The CookieYes banner follows CCPA (opt-out), so visitors' choices are not carried over: they are asked again."
msgstr "CookieYes ribareklaam järgib CCPA-d (opt-out), seega külastajate valikuid ei kanta üle: neid küsitakse uuesti."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-cookieyes.php:60
msgid "Scripts you marked for CookieYes in your theme (data-cookieyes, type=\"text/plain\") stay switched off once it is gone: remove those two attributes so this plugin holds them back instead."
msgstr "Skriptid, mille märgistasid oma teemas CookieYes atribuudiga (data-cookieyes, type=\"text/plain\"), jäävad väljalülitatuks ka pärast selle eemaldamist: eemalda need kaks atribuuti, et see plugin neid hoopis tagasi hoiaks."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-cookieyes.php:283
msgid "CookieYes keeps its data when deleted unless CKY_REMOVE_ALL_DATA is set; use Remove leftover data afterwards. Imports never change its settings."
msgstr "CookieYes säilitab kustutamisel oma andmed, välja arvatud juhul, kui on seatud CKY_REMOVE_ALL_DATA; seejärel kasutage valikut „Eemalda ülejäänud andmed”. Importimine ei muuda kunagi selle sätteid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:64
msgid "Visitors' Ultimate GDPR & CCPA choices are not carried over: its cookie format was not checked on a running site, so visitors are asked again once."
msgstr "Külastajate lõplikke GDPR-i ja CCPA-ga seotud valikuid ei kanta üle: küpsiste vormingut ei kontrollitud töötaval saidil, seega küsitakse külastajatelt uuesti."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:68
msgid "Ultimate GDPR & CCPA was not set to block cookies, so its banner did not hold anything back. This plugin holds back recognised services and the rules below until visitors agree."
msgstr "Ultimate GDPR ja CCPA ei olnud küpsiseid blokeerima seatud, seega ei varjanud selle bänner midagi. See plugin ei varja tunnustatud teenuseid ja allolevaid reegleid, kuni külastajad sellega nõustuvad."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:71
msgid "Ultimate GDPR & CCPA showed its banner only on selected pages. Here the banner shows on every page, so Who is asked first is left as it is."
msgstr "Ultimate GDPR ja CCPA näitasid oma ribareklaami ainult valitud lehtedel. Siin kuvatakse ribareklaami igal lehel, seega jäeti \"Kellelt küsitakse esimesena\" muutmata."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: list of service names with their script keywords.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:83
#, php-format
msgid "These Ultimate GDPR & CCPA script keywords are not addresses, so they are not imported: %s. Add any this plugin does not recognise under Troubleshooting → Also hold back."
msgstr "Need Ultimate GDPR & CCPA skripti märksõnad ei ole aadressid, seega neid ei impordita: %s. Lisage kõik, mida see plugin ei tunne, jaotisse Veaotsing → Samuti oodake tagasi."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: list of shortcodes.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:95
#, php-format
msgid "Its privacy request forms, age gate and acceptance boxes are not cookie consent and are not replaced: %s. They stop working when it is removed; use WordPress's own export and erase personal data tools, or another forms plugin."
msgstr "Selle privaatsustaotluse vormid, vanusepiirang ja nõusolekukastid ei ole küpsiste nõusoleku vormid ja neid ei asendata: %s. Need lakkavad töötamast, kui need eemaldatakse; kasutage WordPress enda isikuandmete eksportimise ja kustutamise tööriistu või mõnda muud vormide pistikprogrammi."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: user name.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:99
#, php-format
msgid "Its cookie scanner left the user %s behind, which it hides from the Users screen while active. Delete that user after deactivating it."
msgstr "Selle küpsiste skanner jättis kasutaja %s maha ja peidab selle aktiivsena olles kasutajate ekraanilt. Kustuta see kasutaja pärast deaktiveerimist."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:102
msgid "Its banner texts are not imported: they describe its own banner."
msgstr "Selle ribareklaami tekste ei impordita: need kirjeldavad selle enda ribareklaami."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-ct-gdpr.php:260
msgid "Deleting Ultimate GDPR & CCPA removes only its files: its settings, services and consent log stay. Remove leftover data deletes its settings and services after it is deactivated, and keeps its consent log and the consents saved on user accounts. Imports never change its settings."
msgstr "Ultimate GDPR ja CCPA kustutamine eemaldab ainult selle failid: selle seaded, teenused ja nõusoleku logi jäävad alles. Ülejäänud andmete eemaldamine kustutab selle seaded ja teenused pärast deaktiveerimist ning säilitab selle nõusoleku logi ja kasutajakontodele salvestatud nõusolekud. Importimine ei muuda kunagi selle seadeid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:69
msgid "Its TCF (IAB framework) setting is not imported and stops when it is removed."
msgstr "Selle TCF-i (IAB raamistiku) sätet ei impordita ja see peatatakse selle eemaldamisel."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:72
msgid "iubenda also handled US or Brazilian privacy laws, which have no equivalent here. Check Who is asked first before switching."
msgstr "iubenda tegeles ka USA ja Brasiilia privaatsusseadustega, millel siin vastet pole. Enne vahetamist kontrollige, kellelt küsitakse."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:75
msgid "iubenda held back Google Tag Manager; this plugin recognises and holds it back too."
msgstr "iubenda hoidis tagasi Google Tag Managerit; see plugin tunneb selle ära ja hoiab ka tagasi."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:78
msgid "iubenda was set up with pasted code, so its banner position and who it asked are not imported."
msgstr "iubenda seadistati kleebitud koodiga, seega selle bänneri positsiooni ja seda, kellelt see küsis, ei impordita."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:82
msgid "A menu has an iubenda preferences link (class iubenda-cs-preferences-link). Replace it with a #cookie-settings link, or rely on the Cookie settings footer link."
msgstr "Menüüs on iubenda eelistuste link (klass iubenda-cs-preferences-link). Asenda see lingiga #cookie-settings või toetu küpsiste sätete jaluse lingile."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:85
msgid "An iubenda legal widget is in a sidebar. It stops showing when iubenda is removed: link to your policies instead."
msgstr "Iubenda juriidiline vidin asub külgribal. See lakkab kuvamast, kui iubenda eemaldatakse: linkige selle asemel oma eeskirjadele."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:88
msgid "iubenda sent form submissions to its hosted consent database. That stops when it is removed; its records stay with iubenda."
msgstr "iubenda saatis vormide esildised oma hostitud nõusolekuandmebaasi. See peatub, kui see eemaldatakse; selle andmed jäävad iubendale."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-iubenda.php:228
msgid "Deleting iubenda removes its settings only if its own delete-on-deactivation option is on; Remove leftover data deletes its settings, form mappings and scheduled checks. Imports never change its settings or contact iubenda."
msgstr "Iubenda kustutamine eemaldab selle sätted ainult siis, kui selle enda suvand „kustuta inaktiveerimisel” on sisse lülitatud; ülejäänud andmete eemaldamine kustutab selle sätted, vormide vastendused ja ajastatud kontrollid. Importimine ei muuda kunagi selle sätteid ega võta iubendaga ühendust."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:98
msgid "Some categories were on before visitors chose, which is not a clear choice: only rejections carry over, and visitors who accepted are asked again."
msgstr "Mõned kategooriad olid juba enne külastajate valiku tegemist sisse lülitatud, mis pole selge valik: ainult tagasilükkamised jäävad kehtima ja külastajatelt, kes vastu võtsid, küsitakse uuesti."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:100
msgid "Its close button accepted all cookies, which is not a clear choice: only rejections carry over, and visitors who accepted are asked again."
msgstr "Selle sulgemisnupp aktsepteeris kõik küpsised, mis pole selge valik: ainult tagasilükkamised jäävad kehtima ja külastajatelt, kes küpsised vastu võtsid, küsitakse uuesti."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:102
msgid "If its add-on accepted cookies on scroll or after a timer, those look the same as Accept: choose Stop carrying over old consent so visitors are asked again."
msgstr "Kui lisandmoodul aktsepteeris küpsiseid kerimisel või pärast taimeri möödumist, näevad need välja samamoodi nagu „Nõustu: vali „Lõpeta vana nõusoleku ülekandmine”, et külastajatelt uuesti küsitaks."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:104
msgid "GDPR Cookie Compliance added your category scripts itself; they stop when it is gone. Add them to your theme or a header-code plugin after switching: the script rules below, and services this plugin recognises, are then held back until visitors allow them. Copy them before removing leftover data."
msgstr "GDPR-i küpsiste nõuetele vastavus lisas teie kategooria skriptid ise; need peatatakse, kui see on kadunud. Lisage need oma teemasse või päisekoodi pistikprogrammile pärast vahetamist: allpool olevad skriptireeglid ja teenused, mida see pistikprogramm tuvastab, hoitakse seejärel alles, kuni külastajad need lubavad. Kopeerige need enne ülejäänud andmete eemaldamist."

# machine translation
#. translators: 1: service name, 2: its tracking ID.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:114
#, php-format
msgid "GDPR Cookie Compliance loaded %1$s (%2$s) itself; it stops when the plugin is gone. Add it to your site another way, such as Site Kit or your theme: this plugin recognises it and holds it back."
msgstr "GDPR-i küpsiste nõuetele vastavuse tagamiseks laaditi %1$s (%2$s) ise; see peatub, kui plugin on kadunud. Lisage see oma saidile muul viisil, näiteks Site Kiti või oma teema abil: see plugin tunneb selle ära ja hoiab selle tagasi."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:127
msgid "no ID"
msgstr "isikutunnistust pole"

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-moove.php:238
msgid "GDPR Cookie Compliance keeps its settings table when deleted; use Remove leftover data afterwards. Copy its category scripts first. Imports never change its settings."
msgstr "GDPR-i küpsiste vastavus säilitab kustutamisel oma sätete tabeli; seejärel kasutage valikut „Eemalda ülejäänud andmed”. Kopeerige kõigepealt selle kategooria skriptid. Importimine ei muuda kunagi selle sätteid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:44
msgid "country bypass"
msgstr "riigi möödasõit"

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:45
msgid "consent forwarding"
msgstr "nõusoleku edastamine"

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:46
msgid "banner-less consent"
msgstr "bänneriteta nõusolek"

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:71
msgid "The Real Cookie Banner banner is switched off, so visitors' choices are not carried over."
msgstr "Päris küpsise bänner on välja lülitatud, seega külastajate valikuid ei kanta üle."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: list of Real Cookie Banner Pro features.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "Real Cookie Banner Pro settings are not imported and stop when it is removed: %s. Check Who is asked first and your Google tags before switching; visitors' choices are not carried over while country bypass or banner-less consent is on."
msgstr "Päris küpsiste ribareklaami Pro seadeid ei impordita ja need peatatakse, kui see eemaldatakse: %s. Enne vahetamist kontrollige, kellelt küsitakse esimesena ja oma Google silte; külastajate valikuid ei kanta üle, kui riigi möödaviik või ribareklaamita nõusolek on sisse lülitatud."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:83
msgid "Real Cookie Banner let visitors choose single services. A category carries over as allowed only when every Real Cookie Banner service in it was accepted; otherwise it is refused. Closing its banner with the close icon is not carried over."
msgstr "Päris küpsisebänner lubas külastajatel valida üksikuid teenuseid. Kategooria jääb lubatuks ainult siis, kui kõik selles olevad päris küpsisebänneri teenused on vastu võetud; vastasel juhul see lükatakse tagasi. Bänneri sulgemine sulgemisikooniga ei kajastu."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: list of service names.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:92
#, php-format
msgid "Real Cookie Banner ran code for these services, which stops when it is removed: %s. Add any code you still need to your theme or a header-code plugin; services this plugin recognises, and the script rules below, are then held back."
msgstr "Real Cookie Banner käivitas nende teenuste jaoks koodi, mis peatub selle eemaldamisel: %s. Lisage oma teemale või päisekoodi pluginale mis tahes kood, mida te endiselt vajate; teenused, mida see plugin ära tunneb, ja allolevad skriptireeglid jäävad seejärel varjatuks."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:95
msgid "A menu has Real Cookie Banner privacy links (#consent-change, #consent-history or #consent-revoke). Replace them with a #cookie-settings link, or rely on the Cookie settings footer link."
msgstr "Menüüs on privaatsuslingid päris küpsiste ribareklaamile (#nõusoleku-muutmine, #nõusoleku-ajalugu või #nõusoleku-tühistamine). Asendage need lingiga #küpsise-seaded või kasutage küpsiste seadete allosas olevat linki."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:98
msgid "Its banner texts are not imported: they describe its own dialog."
msgstr "Selle ribareklaamide tekste ei impordita: need kirjeldavad selle enda dialoogi."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-real-cookie-banner.php:427
msgid "Deleting Real Cookie Banner removes only its copied script files; its settings, services, content blockers and consent records stay. Remove leftover data deletes its settings, services, content blockers, groups and scan and statistics tables, but keeps consent records and the revisions they refer to. Imports never change its settings."
msgstr "Pärisküpsise ribareklaami kustutamisel eemaldatakse ainult kopeeritud skriptifailid; selle seaded, teenused, sisublokeerijad ja nõusolekukirjed jäävad alles. Ülejäänud andmete eemaldamisel kustutatakse selle seaded, teenused, sisublokeerijad, rühmad ning skannimis- ja statistikatabelid, kuid säilitatakse nõusolekukirjed ja nendega seotud muudatused. Importimine ei muuda kunagi selle seadeid."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: name of the old consent plugin.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-source.php:221
#, php-format
msgid "%s keeps its banner texts, categories and cookie scan in its own dashboard, which this import never contacts; only settings saved on this site are imported. Check Who is asked first, Banner position, Banner message and Remember choices for here before switching."
msgstr "%s hoiab oma ribareklaamide tekste, kategooriaid ja küpsiste skannimist oma armatuurlaual, millega see import kunagi ühendust ei võta; imporditakse ainult sellel saidil salvestatud seaded. Enne vahetamist märkige ära „Kellelt küsitakse esimesena“, „Bänneri positsioon“, „Bänneri sõnum“ ja „Pea siin valikud meeles“."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: name of the old consent plugin.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-source.php:223
#, php-format
msgid "Visitors' %s choices are not carried over: its hosted script stores them in a format not checked against a live account, so visitors are asked again once."
msgstr "Külastajate %s valikuid üle ei kanta: selle hostitud skript salvestab need vormingus, mida ei ole reaalajas kontoga võrreldes kontrollitud, seega küsitakse külastajatelt uuesti."

# machine translation
#. translators: 1: name of the old consent plugin, 2: list of service names.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-source.php:233
#, php-format
msgid "Compare %1$s's cookie scan with the services this plugin found on your pages: %2$s. Add anything missing under Troubleshooting → Also hold back."
msgstr "Võrdle %1$s küpsiste skannimist teenustega, mida see plugin sinu lehtedelt leidis: %2$s. Lisa kõik puuduv teave jaotisse Veaotsing → Hoia end tagasi."

# machine translation
#. translators: %s: name of the old consent plugin.
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-source.php:236
#, php-format
msgid "This plugin has not found services on your pages yet. After switching, use Scan now on the Cookie consent tab and compare its list with %s's cookie scan; add anything missing under Troubleshooting → Also hold back."
msgstr "See plugin pole teie lehtedelt veel teenuseid leidnud. Pärast vahetamist kasutage küpsiste nõusoleku vahekaardil valikut „Skanni kohe“ ja võrrelge selle loendit %s küpsiste skannimisega; lisage puuduv teave jaotises Veaotsing → Samuti hoidke tagasi."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-source.php:238
msgid "Consent records it kept on its own servers stay there: export any you must keep before closing that account. Turn on Keep consent records here to go on documenting choices."
msgstr "Konto enda serverites hoitud nõusolekuandmed jäävad sinna: enne konto sulgemist eksportige kõik, mida peate alles hoidma. Valikute dokumenteerimise jätkamiseks lülitage sisse „Säilita nõusolekuandmed siin“."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-termly.php:42
msgid "Termly's auto blocker held back scripts it recognised. This plugin holds back the services it recognises; compare the lists above."
msgstr "Termly automaatne blokeerija blokeeris skripte, mida see tuvastas. See plugin blokeerib teenuseid, mida see tuvastab; võrdle ülaltoodud loendeid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-termly.php:46
msgid "Termly may have added a \"TermlyBot\" section to your robots.txt file. Remove it after switching, if it is there."
msgstr "Termly võis teie robots.txt faili lisada jaotise \"TermlyBot\". Eemaldage see pärast vahetamist, kui see seal on."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-termly.php:128
msgid "Deleting Termly leaves its settings and daily account check; Remove leftover data deletes them, including its saved API key. Imports never change its settings or contact Termly."
msgstr "Termly kustutamine jätab alles oma seaded ja igapäevase kontokontrolli; ülejäänud andmete eemaldamine kustutab need, sealhulgas salvestatud API-võtme. Importimine ei muuda kunagi seadeid ega võta ühendust Termlyga."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-wpconsent.php:53
msgid "The WPConsent banner is switched off, so visitors' choices are not carried over."
msgstr "WPConsenti ribareklaam on välja lülitatud, seega külastajate valikuid ei kanta üle."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-wpconsent.php:56
msgid "WPConsent let visitors choose single services. Only its Statistics and Marketing choices carry over; anyone who chose only some services in a category is asked again."
msgstr "WPConsent lubas külastajatel valida üksikuid teenuseid. Ainult statistika ja turunduse valikud jäävad kehtima; kõigil, kes valisid kategoorias ainult mõned teenused, küsitakse uuesti."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-wpconsent.php:58
msgid "WPConsent Pro geolocation rules and custom scripts are not imported: check Who is asked first, and add any custom scripts to your theme or a header-code plugin before switching."
msgstr "WPConsent Pro geograafilise asukoha reegleid ja kohandatud skripte ei impordita: enne vahetamist kontrollige valikut „Kellelt küsitakse esimesena” ja lisage oma teemale või päisekoodi pistikprogrammile kõik kohandatud skriptid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate-wpconsent.php:180
msgid "WPConsent removes its cookie list and settings when deleted only if its own delete-data option is on; Remove leftover data deletes its settings and scan tables but not that cookie list. Imports never change its settings."
msgstr "WPConsent eemaldab oma küpsiste loendi ja sätted kustutamisel ainult siis, kui selle enda andmete kustutamise suvand on sisse lülitatud; ülejäänud andmete eemaldamine kustutab küll sätted ja skannimistabelid, kuid mitte küpsiste loendit. Importimine ei muuda kunagi sätteid."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:109
msgid "Unknown import source."
msgstr "Tundmatu impordiallikas."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:168
msgid "You cannot import settings."
msgstr "Te ei saa sätteid importida."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:204
msgid "You do not have permission for this action."
msgstr "Teil pole selle toimingu jaoks luba."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:207
msgid "Another import action is running. If an interrupted action left a lock, review its import record before removing the lock."
msgstr "Teine imporditoiming on pooleli. Kui katkestatud toiming jättis luku, vaadake enne luku eemaldamist üle selle impordikirje."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:225
msgid "Unknown import action."
msgstr "Tundmatu imporditoiming."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:251
msgid "A selected page cannot be edited with a saved revision."
msgstr "Valitud lehte ei saa salvestatud redaktsiooniga muuta."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:266
msgid "A source document could not render. It was not replaced."
msgstr "Lähtedokumenti ei saanud renderdada. Seda ei asendatud."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:280
msgid "A page revision could not be saved. Nothing was replaced."
msgstr "Lehekülje redaktsiooni ei saanud salvestada. Midagi ei asendatud."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:309
msgid "The undo record could not be saved."
msgstr "Tagasivõtmise kirjet ei saanud salvestada."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:361
msgid "This import cannot be undone."
msgstr "Seda importi ei saa tagasi võtta."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:367
msgid "Settings changed after import. Restore the imported values before undoing, so later edits are not lost."
msgstr "Seaded muudeti pärast importimist. Enne tagasivõtmist taastage imporditud väärtused, et hilisemad muudatused kaotsi ei läheks."

# machine translation
#: includes/migrate/class-seoprocookieconsent-migrate.php:373
msgid "A page changed after import or its revision is missing. Undo was stopped to protect later edits."
msgstr "Pärast importimist muudetud leht või selle redaktsioon puudub. Tagasivõtmine peatati hilisemate muudatuste kaitsmiseks."

# machine translation
